    "title": "The Fried Catfish At This Kentucky Restaurant Is Worth Every Friday Drive - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Terri Burgan ,\n1 days ago Craving golden, crispy catfish that’s worth planning your Friday around? In Eddyville, Kentucky, Willow Pond Catfish Restaurant has earned a devoted following for its Southern comfort classics, friendly service, and small-town warmth. With a 4.6-star rating and crowds that happily wait for hush puppies and white beans, this spot turns a simple fish fry into a weekly ritual. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
